<title>USA: Maine Yankee nuclear plant seen back up next week.</title>
<headline>Maine Yankee nuclear plant seen back up next week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Owners of Maine Yankee nuclear power plant said Thursday they expect the 910 megawatt (MW) unit to be back on line next week.</p>
<p>The unit tripped off line Wednesday during testing of the reactor protective system.</p>
